---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service — NodalPulse"
  description="NodalPulse terms of service: acceptable use, subscription terms, and limitations."
>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">Last updated: May 10, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-body">

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Acceptance</h2>
          <p>
            By creating an account or using NodalPulse, you agree to these terms. If you are using
            NodalPulse on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have authority to bind
            that organization to these terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Service description</h2>
          <p>
            NodalPulse delivers a daily morning brief covering regulatory activity at PUCT, ERCOT,
            FERC (ERCOT-tagged actions), and the Texas Legislature relevant to energy market participants.
            Briefs are delivered by email on weekday mornings. Coverage and delivery schedules may
            change with reasonable notice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Subscriptions and billing</h2>
          <p>
            Paid subscriptions are billed in advance on a recurring basis. You may cancel at any time
            through the billing portal; cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period.
            Refunds are not issued for partial periods. Prices may change with 30 days' notice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Acceptable use</h2>
          <p>
            Brief content is licensed for your personal or organizational use and may not be redistributed,
            resold, or published without written permission. Automated scraping of the application is
            prohibited. You may not use the service in violation of applicable law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            NodalPulse summarizes and cites public regulatory filings. Content is provided for
            informational purposes only and does not constitute legal, financial, or regulatory advice.
            We make reasonable efforts toward accuracy but do not warrant that briefs are complete or
            error-free. Verify material information against source filings before acting on it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the extent permitted by law, NodalPulse's liability for any claim arising from use of
            the service is limited to the amount paid by you in the 12 months preceding the claim.
            We are not liable for indirect, consequential, or punitive damages.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:hello@nodalpulse.com">hello@nodalpulse.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
